  "description": "'Jodi', a girl who left her hometown to come to the city in search of a job, is a housekeeper for 'Mel', who is rumored to be crazy, in the city full of danger. Mel asks Jodi, whom she just met, to bring her a 'corpse' out of the blue..! A story about various weak people shown by 'Mel', a magician who can only burn corpses, and 'Jodi', a girl who learned about the world too early. \n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
